# Wake timers through SDL's own loop: once the view's first paint (2.6 s) is over, the pointer
# rests on each number box in turn (x 330 to 437 at 1440 x 900), and each rest arms the 400 ms tip
# timer, which wakes the idle loop at its deadline (--trace logs how late).
size 1440 900
density 2
wait 3000
move 383 424
wait 700
move 383 468
wait 700
move 383 529
wait 700
move 383 573
wait 700
move 383 424
wait 700
move 700 700
wait 300
